        "imageUrl2": "https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max500/715211101.jpg?k=48f45d849ff678d56da5853b4e7dedbefa4607fda27448aaa42a13d8317e0e81&o=",
        "description_fr": "Situé dans le centre de Jokkmokk, cet hôtel propose des chambres décorées individuellement avec une télévision à écran plat et une connexion Wi-Fi gratuite. La gare routière de Jokkmokk se trouve à 260 mètres.  Le stationnement sur place est gratuit.\n\nToutes les chambres de l'Hotel Akerlund disposent d'un coin salon ainsi que d'une salle de bains privative avec douche et articles de toilette gratuits.\n\nVous pourrez vous détendre dans l'espace détente doté d'un sauna et dans le salon commun avec cheminée et télévision. Le restaurant saisonnier de l'Akerlund Hotel sert uniquement le petit-déjeuner en été et le dîner en hiver.\n\nLa montagne Attje et le musée Sami sont accessibles en 3 minutes à pied. L'hôtel se trouve à 600 mètres d'une plage et à 10 km du cercle arctique.",
        "description_en": "Situated in central Jokkmokk, this hotel offers individually decorated rooms with a flat-screen TV and free Wi-Fi access. Jokkmokk Bus Station is 260 metres away.  Parking is free on site.\n\nAll rooms at Hotel Akerlund feature a seating area, as well as a private bathroom with a shower and free toiletries.\n\nRelaxation options include a relax area with a sauna and a shared fireplace lounge with a TV. Akerlund Hotel's seasonal in-house restaurant serves only breakfast during summer, and serves breakfast and dinner during winter.\n\nAttje Mountain and the Sami Museum are a 3-minute walk away. A beach is found 600 metres from the hotel, while the Arctic Circle is 10 km away.\n\nCouples particularly like the location — they rated it 8.9 for a two-person trip.",
        "description_es": "Este hotel está situado en el centro de Jokkmokk y ofrece habitaciones decoradas de forma individual con TV de pantalla plana y conexión Wi-Fi gratuita. La estación de autobuses de Jokkmokk está a 260 metros.  El aparcamiento es gratuito.\n\nTodas las habitaciones del Hotel Akerlund cuentan con zona de estar y baño privado con ducha y artículos de aseo gratuitos.\n\nEl establecimiento alberga una zona de relajación con sauna y un salón compartido con chimenea y TV. El restaurante de temporada del Akerlund Hotel solo sirve desayunos en verano y cenas en invierno.\n\nLa montaña Attje y el Museo Sami están a 3 minutos a pie. El hotel está a 600 metros de una playa y a 10 km del Círculo Polar Ártico.\n\nA las parejas les encanta la ubicación — Le han puesto un 8,9 para viajes de dos personas.",
        "description_pt": "Situated in central Jokkmokk, this hotel offers individually decorated rooms with a flat-screen TV and free Wi-Fi access. Jokkmokk Bus Station is 260 metres away.  Parking is free on site.\n\nAll rooms at Hotel Akerlund feature a seating area, as well as a private bathroom with a shower and free toiletries.\n\nRelaxation options include a relax area with a sauna and a shared fireplace lounge with a TV. Akerlund Hotel's seasonal in-house restaurant serves only breakfast during summer, and serves breakfast and dinner during winter.\n\nAttje Mountain and the Sami Museum are a 3-minute walk away. A beach is found 600 metres from the hotel, while the Arctic Circle is 10 km away.\n\nOs casais gostam particularmente da localização – deram uma pontuação de 8,9 para uma viagem a dois.",
        "description_it": "Situated in central Jokkmokk, this hotel offers individually decorated rooms with a flat-screen TV and free Wi-Fi access. Jokkmokk Bus Station is 260 metres away.  Parking is free on site.\n\nAll rooms at Hotel Akerlund feature a seating area, as well as a private bathroom with a shower and free toiletries.\n\nRelaxation options include a relax area with a sauna and a shared fireplace lounge with a TV. Akerlund Hotel's seasonal in-house restaurant serves only breakfast during summer, and serves breakfast and dinner during winter.\n\nAttje Mountain and the Sami Museum are a 3-minute walk away. A beach is found 600 metres from the hotel, while the Arctic Circle is 10 km away.\n\nLe coppie apprezzano molto la posizione: l'hanno valutata 8,9 per un viaggio a due.",
